    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Detached five bedroom period residence.\r\nSpacious and well proportioned accommodation laid out over three storeys.\r\nBoasting original features such as sash windows, ornate cornicing and high ceilings.\r\nScenic coastal location within 230m of Shanganagh Bay Beach.\r\nAmenities in Killiney and Bray are also within easy reach.\r\nThe area is well serviced by public transport links offering ease of access to Dublin city centre and further afield.\r\nExtending to approximately 289 sq. m (3,111 sq. ft).\r\nOn a site area extending to approximately 0.2 hectares (0.5 acres).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property provides a detached five bedroom period residence with gardens to the front and rear. The property is arranged over ground and two upper floors beneath a pitched roof. This property offers off street parking. We are informed the property extends to approximately 289 sq. m (3,111 sq. ft).\r\n\r\nVacant Possession."
      },
